==Battleground==
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Diabrollow]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Fallen Bear]]s spawn, delay 80~86.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Diabrollow]] spawns after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Diabrollow]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**3 [[Diabrollow]]s spawn after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]]'s surges wall the Diabrollows and deal heavy damage to Fallen Bear as well as chipping Le'Noir. Bring support like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] for the frontliners and [[Ancient Egg: N109 (Rare Cat)|Barrel Cat]] to kill Fallen Bear quicker and this stage will go down very fast. Don't forget [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] to deny Zang Roo's burrows.

==Trivia==
*Natural Rejection is a pun on [[wikipedia:Natural Selection|natural selection]].

